illation under reduced pressure</h3>\n<p>This method is used for a <strong>liquid that decomposes at its boiling point</strong>. By reducing pressure, the boiling point decreases and decomposition is avoided.</p>\n<p>So,</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.813ex\" height=\"1.57ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 3895.6 694\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D437\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D437\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1105.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2383.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2887.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3391.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Thus, the correct matching is:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"34.882ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 15417.8 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(972.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1972.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=